


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_090594ca:



    voice "2HI_1548"
    hina "「午休时的那个样子，真的很不好哦，伦」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_bf466fd5:



    voice "2RI_1549"
    rin "「你到底要说几次啊，都说我知道了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_3860447f:



    voice "2HI_1549"
    hina "「就是看你不知道所以我才说的啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_3ec9112c:


    "阳菜所指摘的是伦一脸不悦地赶走那些跟文搭话的咿哇鬼叫的女生那件事。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_e1b9893e:


    "当时阳菜都无法圆场了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_6d179150:


    "面对阳菜的责备伦依然一副怏怏不服的模样，看见这状况的文似乎因为心感愧疚而显得坐立不安。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_e6773bcd:



    voice "2FU_1165"
    fumi "「抱歉啊，都怪我没能好好地结束话题」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_9b67e14a:


    hina_rin "「这不是浅生的错」\n「这不是文的错」" (what_rest_indent=0)


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_2649ee0f:


    hina_rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_f4561deb:


    "异口同声的两人四目相对起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_7cf3e226:



    voice "2FU_1166"
    fumi "「总而言之待会我跟家里人一起听听看那边是怎么说吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_f8db35cd:


    "没错。艺能事务所的人跑到文的家里来了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_d93e8af6:


    "结果到最后并没有在电话里讲明而是变成直接面谈了……应该说是对面那些老谋深算的人的巧妙诱导吗。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_5251774a:



    voice "2FU_1167"
    fumi "「话说，今天的晚饭……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_f591411d:



    voice "2HI_1552"
    hina "「啊啊真的是。那些就用不着你费心啦。我们会想办法搞定。别说了巴士快到了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_dfd97a67:



    voice "2FU_1168"
    fumi "「非、非常感谢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_e0047c08:


    "行了个大大的鞠躬礼。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_1636ad56:



    voice "2HI_1553"
    hina "「我还有点事要去趟办公室，再送你一段路吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_03418251:



    voice "2RI_1552"
    rin "「啊，我也一起……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_98332057:



    voice "2HI_1554"
    hina "「今天是伦值日打扫吧！休想溜掉！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_6ff95171:


    "伦一步一摇地打算跟上来结果被阳菜一扭头吼了回去。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_246ffffa:



    voice "2RI_1553"
    rin "「啊……呜呜」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_61d49361:


    "她一脸消沉地目送两人离去。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_d8c71c68:


    "而察觉到气氛不对的圣夜子向伦搭话。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_86c4755e:



    voice "2MI_1051"
    miyako "「我来帮你打扫教室吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_02_9a5de164:



    voice "2RI_1554"
    rin "「……谢谢」"
